<p>Your mere presence is a blight in your foes minds. Using this link you are able to reach out and steal a talent from a target.</p><p>For <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">6, 14, 20, 25, 29</acronym> turns you will be able to use a random active (not passive, not sustained) talent from your target, and they will loose it.</p><p>You may not steal a talent which you already know.</p><p>The stolen talent will not use any resources to activate.</p><p>At level 5 you are able to choose which talent to steal.</p><p>The talent stolen will be limited to at most level <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 4, 5.</acronym></p>